  ozelFonksiyon: 
  aciklama:
  - "\"\u0130ki y\xFCzl\xFC katipler, akrabalar, dostlar, karde\u015Fler; her \u015Feyi
    harcamal\u0131 m\u0131?... D\xFCnya sanki yepyeniymi\u015F gibi, bug\xFCn sabahlar\u0131n
    ilkiymi\u015F gibi, hala \u015Fafak vaktiymi\u015F gibi... Do\u011Frusunu s\xF6ylemek
    gerekirse say\u0131n katipler, hali haz\u0131rda harcanm\u0131\u015F olan, bizi
    hayal k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131na u\u011Fratan, kendi \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFCz...
    Ger\xE7ekten sevebilmek i\xE7in, sevgiye ruhunu verebilmek i\xE7in kaybedecek
    bir \u015Feyi olmamal\u0131 insan\u0131n. Pervas\u0131zca at\u0131lmaya cesaret
    edebilmek i\xE7in t\xFCm zirveleri a\u015Fm\u0131\u015F olmal\u0131y\u0131z.
    O an seninle olmak i\xE7in en kat\u0131 h\xFCk\xFCmdarlar\u0131n, en b\xFCy\xFCk
    f\u0131rt\u0131nalar\u0131n d\xFC\u015F\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFC g\xF6rmeli insan.
    Seninle hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi harcamamak i\xE7in her \u015Feyi ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015F,
    her \u015Feyi defalarca harcam\u0131\u015F olmal\u0131y\u0131z. A\u015Fk yepyeniyken,
    tertemizken hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fil. F\u0131rt\u0131nadan \xF6nceki a\u015Fk
    se\xE7im de\u011Fil, bi\xE7im. Ba\u015F\u0131ma bir \u015Fey geldi\u011Finde,
    beni \xFCzg\xFCn g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCnde, orada ol a\u015Fk\u0131m... Do\u011Fru
    s\xF6z\xFC s\xF6yle, do\u011Fru bak\u0131\u015F\u0131 bul... Evet a\u015Fk\u0131m,
    i\u015Fte o zaman; bana g\xFCven, orada olaca\u011F\u0131m. Ne olursa olsun,
    ka\xE7\u0131rmayaca\u011F\u0131m! \u0130\u015Fte o zaman, tek ses, tek a\u011F\u0131z,
    biz kazanaca\u011F\u0131z!...\""
